# SmartSense ONE styling

Read `STYLING-S1.md` before styling. Tokens live in `src/design/colors_and_type.css` (imported at app root). Never mix with `@joltup/colors` in the same component.

```ts
// ✅
backgroundColor: 'var(--ss-bg-surface)',
borderRadius: 'var(--ss-rd-4)',
fontFamily: 'var(--ss-font-sans)',

// ❌
backgroundColor: '#ffffff',
```

Allowed hex literals only: `#6b1717` and `#6b3600` (on-white contrast overrides). If a token is missing, stop and flag it. Do not inline a literal.

- Semantic colors (`--ss-danger` / `--ss-warning` / `--ss-success` / `--ss-info`) are status signals, never decoration.
- Proxima Nova only via `var(--ss-font-sans)`. Never choose Roboto.
- Badges: `--ss-rd-4`. Pills are for status dots and avatars only.
- Card shadows stay static. Modal overlay is a solid scrim — no `backdrop-filter: blur()`.
- Emotion + `label` matching the component name. Lucide icons at 24×24, strokeWidth 1.4 (inline 16).
